WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.702
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:03.836
We hope you're
doing well tonight

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.338
and now, we're going
to get to the news.

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:08.774
Florida Senator Rick Scott
yesterday criticized Disney

00:00:08.774 --> 00:00:10.643
for coming out
against his state's

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:12.511
so-called Don't Say Gay law

00:00:12.511 --> 00:00:14.948
and said he won't go back
to the theme park.

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:17.884
Oh, no!
You mean we won't get to see

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:19.786
Rick Scott at Disney World?

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:20.854
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:23.389
Kids, do you even still
want to go?

00:00:23.389 --> 00:00:25.191
[ Laughter ]
That's like saying,

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:26.726
the trip's booked,
but heads-up --

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:28.761
The Hall of Presidents
is closed.

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:30.329
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:30.329 --> 00:00:33.199
After it was announced that
Elon Musk had purchased Twitter,

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:36.603
the social media platform's
co-founder Jack Dorsey

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:39.872
endorsed the sale
and said he trusts Musk's

00:00:39.872 --> 00:00:43.142
"mission to extend the light
of consciousness."

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:44.910
Well, I feel a lot better,

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:47.180
knowing that Twitter wasn't
in great hands before.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.315
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:51.884
President Biden said yesterday
he tried to congratulate

00:00:51.884 --> 00:00:54.753
French President Emanuel Macron
on his reelection,

00:00:54.753 --> 00:00:56.990
but was unable to reach him
because Macron was

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:59.992
"at the Eiffel Tower,
having a good time."

00:00:59.992 --> 00:01:01.527
[ Laughter ]
Oof!

00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:02.428
That's got to hurt.

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:04.097
That's not even a good lie.

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:05.165
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:06.766
[ French accent ]
Uh, President Macron?

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:08.234
He is, uh...

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.235
at ze Eiffel Tower?

00:01:10.235 --> 00:01:13.372
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:13.372 --> 00:01:15.708
He is having a good time.

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:17.810
Yeah, he has a baguette.

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:20.947
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:22.782
House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:24.717
led a group
of Republicans yesterday

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:26.652
on a visit
to the U.S.-Mexico border,

00:01:26.652 --> 00:01:29.589
but Ted Cruz wasn't with them
because he has no interest

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:32.157
in only going halfway to Cancún.

00:01:32.157 --> 00:01:34.394
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:37.329
A woman in California recently
survived being stranded

00:01:37.329 --> 00:01:40.466
inside her car in the snow
for nearly a week

00:01:40.466 --> 00:01:42.702
by eating one yogurt per day.

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:44.603
And, unfortunately
for the rescue team,

00:01:44.603 --> 00:01:45.872
it was Activia.

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.974
[ Laughter ]
"Whoa!"

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:53.112
"Don't, worry, ma'am we got --
Ohhh!"

00:01:53.112 --> 00:01:57.617
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.617 --> 00:02:03.155
How did we want them to react?,
I guess, is a fair question.

00:02:03.155 --> 00:02:04.724
Delta Airlines announced today

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:06.159
that its
flight attendants' shifts

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:07.693
will begin during boarding,

00:02:07.693 --> 00:02:09.829
instead of after the
plane's doors close,

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:11.931
so if you think boarding
was slow before...

00:02:11.931 --> 00:02:13.766
[ Laughter ]
"Alright, we'll now begin

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:15.969
boarding anybody
with a January birthday.

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:16.935
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.935 --> 00:02:18.604
Januarys, you are welcome

00:02:18.604 --> 00:02:20.540
to board at this time."

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:21.974
And, finally,
officials in New York

00:02:21.974 --> 00:02:23.309
are reportedly considering

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:25.878
allowing pizzerias
and other restaurants

00:02:25.878 --> 00:02:27.914
to sell cannabis-infused foods.

00:02:27.914 --> 00:02:30.883
"Oh, they only come here
if they're already high,"

00:02:30.883 --> 00:02:31.984
said Papa John's.

00:02:31.984 --> 00:02:33.319
[ Laughter and applause ]
And that was

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:34.921
a monologue, everybody!

